{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705570/extras/PNG_Text_FIX_-_Reach_Princess.png?t=1746957638\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705570/extras/Gif_neu_-_jump_knight_princess.gif?t=1746957638\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Knight Jump is a tricky platformer, inspired by the classic &quot;Jump King&quot;!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master precise but fair jumps!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't fall or start over again!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reach new highscores!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705570/extras/PNG_Text_400_-_Hell_soul.png?t=1746957638\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705570/extras/Gif_neu_-_jump_knight_hell.gif?t=1746957638\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It won't be easy, because the Horrors of the depth are chasing you!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jump out of Hell</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Avoid the darkness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And don't die (Pro Advice)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705570/extras/PNG_Text_400_-_Take_Rest.png?t=1746957638\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705570/extras/Gif_neu_-_jump_knight_rest.gif?t=1746957638\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Traverse different worlds until you reach the princess!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Graveyard</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705570/extras/Gif_Neu_-_Knight_Jump_Graveyard.gif?t=1746957638\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ice Land</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705570/extras/Gif_neu_-_jump_knight_snow.gif?t=1746957638\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and more!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>Have fun with this little Horror Action Plattformer and maybe help me feed my Cat! :)</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705570/extras/Cat_with_Knight_3.4.1.jpg?t=1746957638\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3705570?t=1746957638","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3705570?t=1746957638","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705570/20f8fad7d45b1c55b286eaddc2d93fae31bbcfed/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746957638","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705570/20f8fad7d45b1c55b286eaddc2d93fae31bbcfed/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746957638","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705570/extras/PNG_Text_FIX_-_Reach_Princess.png?t=1746957638\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705570/extras/Gif_neu_-_jump_knight_princess.gif?t=1746957638\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Knight Jump is a tricky platformer, inspired by the classic &quot;Jump King&quot;!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master precise bu